  Committee says that the committee is  actually going to vote on this extension  today and there is a lot of reason for  optimism for these first responders  because there's a lot of bipartisan  support this time around even from  fiscal conservatives who had balked at  the price tag in the past so it looks  like a measure will pass  at some point but as you know who  Anthony Congress doesn't always move in  a very expeditious manner no it does not  Nancy thank you very much
 

